    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you unlock the secrets of the periodic table and become the ultimate blob chemist? Collect elemental blobs, watch them drop elements from their periodic table rows, and combine them to create powerful compounds that generate Atoms\u2014your clicks per second!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each element you collect and compound you create, you'll get closer to uncovering noble gases and completing your ultimate collection. Will you master the art of chemistry and dominate both the periodic table and the clicker world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collecting &amp; Periodic Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/22c18c4f60a75d6e751504be822d22c4.poster.avif?t=1749729279\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/22c18c4f60a75d6e751504be822d22c4.webm?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/22c18c4f60a75d6e751504be822d22c4.mp4?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Elements:</strong> Explore the periodic table by collecting Blobs that represent real chemical elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blob Drops:</strong> Claim one Blob per hour for <strong>each row where you own at least one Blob</strong>. Collect elements from the periodic table and use them to expand your collection and power your discoveries!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Rows:</strong> Unlock all the elements in a row to reveal its <strong>noble gas</strong> and gain access to the <strong>next row</strong> of the periodic table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine and Experiment:</strong> Use the elements you\u2019ve collected to <strong>craft compounds</strong>, just like a real chemist! Each compound you create not only unlocks new possibilities but also fuels your <strong>Atoms (clicks per second)</strong>\u2014and that\u2019s where the clicker fun begins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Fun:</strong> Learn about the elements and their compounds while having a blob-tastic time. Collect, combine, and explore the world of chemistry like never before!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clicker Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/459c78980706d6570faa66a3e7b4fb19.poster.avif?t=1749729279\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/459c78980706d6570faa66a3e7b4fb19.webm?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/459c78980706d6570faa66a3e7b4fb19.mp4?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atoms = Clicks</strong>: Compounds generate &quot;Atoms&quot;\u2014your clicks per second. The more compounds you create, the faster you earn clicks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up Your Compounds</strong>: Use your clicks to upgrade your compounds, boosting your Atom output and accelerating progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Progression</strong>: Whether you\u2019re actively clicking or letting your Blobs do the work, Blob keeps the chemistry flowing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to be blobbed in this element-filled adventure where science meets fun, and everything blobs with chemistry!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you unlock the secrets of the periodic table and become the ultimate blob chemist? Collect elemental blobs, watch them drop elements from their periodic table rows, and combine them to create powerful compounds that generate Atoms\u2014your clicks per second!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each element you collect and compound you create, you'll get closer to uncovering noble gases and completing your ultimate collection. Will you master the art of chemistry and dominate both the periodic table and the clicker world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collecting &amp; Periodic Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/22c18c4f60a75d6e751504be822d22c4.poster.avif?t=1749729279\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/22c18c4f60a75d6e751504be822d22c4.webm?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/22c18c4f60a75d6e751504be822d22c4.mp4?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Elements:</strong> Explore the periodic table by collecting Blobs that represent real chemical elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blob Drops:</strong> Claim one Blob per hour for <strong>each row where you own at least one Blob</strong>. Collect elements from the periodic table and use them to expand your collection and power your discoveries!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Rows:</strong> Unlock all the elements in a row to reveal its <strong>noble gas</strong> and gain access to the <strong>next row</strong> of the periodic table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine and Experiment:</strong> Use the elements you\u2019ve collected to <strong>craft compounds</strong>, just like a real chemist! Each compound you create not only unlocks new possibilities but also fuels your <strong>Atoms (clicks per second)</strong>\u2014and that\u2019s where the clicker fun begins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Fun:</strong> Learn about the elements and their compounds while having a blob-tastic time. Collect, combine, and explore the world of chemistry like never before!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clicker Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/459c78980706d6570faa66a3e7b4fb19.poster.avif?t=1749729279\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/459c78980706d6570faa66a3e7b4fb19.webm?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154520/extras/459c78980706d6570faa66a3e7b4fb19.mp4?t=1749729279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atoms = Clicks</strong>: Compounds generate &quot;Atoms&quot;\u2014your clicks per second. The more compounds you create, the faster you earn clicks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up Your Compounds</strong>: Use your clicks to upgrade your compounds, boosting your Atom output and accelerating progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Progression</strong>: Whether you\u2019re actively clicking or letting your Blobs do the work, Blob keeps the chemistry flowing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to be blobbed in this element-filled adventure where science meets fun, and everything blobs with chemistry!</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a chemistry-packed adventure! Collect elements, combine them into compounds, and generate Atoms (clicks per second). Use Atoms to level up compounds, unlocking noble gases and new rows as you build the ultimate periodic table collection!",
